.TH "JSONKIT\-MCP\-UNINSTALL" "1" "" "jsonkit 0.0.0" ""
.SH "NAME"
jsonkit\-mcp\-uninstall \- Remove this application\(aqs MCP server from your coding agents.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBjsonkit mcp uninstall\fR [options]
.fi
.SH "OPTIONS"
.TP
\fB\-\-agent\fR <\fIagent\fR>
The agent to remove it from: claude or codex. Every agent it is registered with when left out. One of: claude, codex.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
\fBjsonkit\fR(1), \fBjsonkit\-mcp\fR(1)
